    {
      "slide_index": 9,
      "text": "僕は、ルーミアの後を追いかけ、霧の湖までくると、荒れた呼吸を整えようと、大きく息を吸う。",
      "notes": "（操夢）僕は、ルーミアの後を追いかけ、霧の湖までくると、荒れた呼吸を整えようと、大きく息を吸う。",
      "character": "操夢",
      "voice": "imd1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 115,
      "phonemes": "ボクワ、ルーミアノアトオオイカケ、キリノミズウミマデクルト、アレタコキュウオトトノエヨウト、オオキクイキオスウ。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 7.744580498866213,
      "audio_file": "slide_009.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第3話/第3話.009.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "sound_effects": [],
      "effect": "none",
      "quality_enhance": true,
      "sound_effect": null,
      "se_offset": 0,
      "no_voice": false,
      "is_skipped": false,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第3話/slide_009.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787832594082
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 10,
      "text": "だが、息を吸い始めると、動悸と眩暈が僕を襲い、ふと、今朝見た夢の続きを思い出す。",
      "notes": "（操夢）だが、息を吸い始めると、動悸と眩暈が僕を襲い、ふと、今朝見た夢の続きを思い出す。",
      "character": "操夢",
      "voice": "imd1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 115,
      "phonemes": "ダガ、イキオスイハジメルト、ドウキトメマイガボクオオソイ、フト、ケサミタユメノツズキオオモイダス。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 7.3376190476190475,
      "audio_file": "slide_010.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第3話/第3話.010.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "sound_effects": [],
      "effect": "none",
      "quality_enhance": true,
      "sound_effect": null,
      "se_offset": 0,
      "no_voice": false,
      "is_skipped": false,
      "audio_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/音声/第3話/slide_010.wav",
      "_cacheBuster": 1787832637317
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 11,
      "text": "僕は、ふと立ちあがろうとすると、黒く大きな何かが、僕を覆い始める。僕は、それを押さえながら、彼女に駆け寄る。",
      "notes": "（操夢）僕は、ふと立ちあがろうとすると、黒く大きな何かが、僕を覆い始める。僕は、それを押さえながら、彼女に駆け寄る。",
      "character": "操夢",
      "voice": "imd1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 115,
      "phonemes": "ボクワ、フトタチアガロウトスルト、クロクオオキナナニカガ、ボクオオオイハジメル。ボクワ、ソレオオサエナガラ、カノジョニカケヨル。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
        "characters": [],
        "background": []
      },
      "character_images": "",
      "bg_images": [],
      "telop_frame_detected": true,
      "audio_duration": 9.73077097505669,
      "audio_file": "slide_011.wav",
      "image_path": "/Volumes/ZSSD/GitHub/repository/Toho-Project-Second-Story/幼き日の夢/スライド画像/第3話/第3話.011.jpeg",
      "video_clip_path": null,
      "animation_path": null,
      "video_start_time": 0,
      "video_duration": null,
      "animation_duration": null,
      "is_enabled": true,
      "sound_effects": []
    },
    {
      "slide_index": 12,
      "text": "「ほら、一緒に神社に行くよ。」",
      "notes": "（霊夢）「ほら、一緒に神社に行くよ。」",
      "character": "霊夢",
      "voice": "f1",
      "speed": 100,
      "pitch": 100,
      "phonemes": "ホラ、イッショニジンジャニイクヨ。",
      "extra_delay": 0,
      "transition_delay": 0.5,
      "transition_duration": 1,
      "transition_effect": "no transition effect",
      "target_duration": null,
      "is_animation_sync": false,
      "has_animation": false,
      "animated_objects": [],
      "animation_details": {
        "presenter_notes": [],
        "transitions": [],
        "images": [],
